Assets
------
The code of this repository is AGPL-3.0-only. The files under `assets/` are map data copied
unmodified from the upstream `resources/maps` directory (Iceland and Australia: manifest.json,
map.bin, map4x.bin, map16x.bin). They are Creative Commons BY-SA 4.0 licensed; attribution:
"OpenFront" / "OpenFront Inc." See LICENSE-ASSETS (verbatim from upstream),
assets/LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt, and assets/CREDITS-upstream.md (the upstream credits for the
underlying map data sources, which include OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), Natural Earth
(public domain) and others). Small test maps under crates/of-engine/tests/testdata,
crates/of-engine/tests/p4b_vectors/maps and crates/of-engine/src/water/testdata/maps are
likewise copied from upstream (upstream tests/testdata and resources/maps) and carry the same
terms; see the README.md in each of those directories.

The file crates/of-engine/src/map/maps_gen.rs embeds data generated from upstream map-generator
assets (map-generator/assets/maps/*/info.json, via upstream Maps.gen.ts) by tools/gen_p3_tables.py.
The upstream map assets are CC BY-SA 4.0 and the generated table is covered by the same attribution.

No proprietary upstream asset is included. The upstream `/proprietary` directory ("All Rights
Reserved") and any asset served from OpenFront's servers are NOT part of this repository and must
never be added to it.

